# Lorehold Charm, second mode: "Return target artifact or creature card with mana value 2 or less from your graveyard to the
# battlefield." Faithless Looting leaves three cards in Bot1's graveyard: Misshapen Fiend (a creature card with mana value
# exactly 2, the boundary), Simian Spirit Guide (a creature card with mana value 3, refused) and Faithless Looting itself (neither
# artifact nor creature, refused). Only the Fiend is chosen and it returns to the battlefield under Bot1's control; the
# other two stay.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Faithless Looting
Simian Spirit Guide
Misshapen Fiend
Lorehold Charm
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Simian Spirit Guide; Misshapen Fiend)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lorehold Charm.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Return target artifact or creature card)
! Bot1.Target(Simian Spirit Guide)
! Bot1.Target(Faithless Looting)
Bot1.Target(Misshapen Fiend)
Bot2.Pass
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Ruby; Mox Pearl; Misshapen Fiend
Bot1.Graveyard = Lorehold Charm; Faithless Looting; Simian Spirit Guide
Bot1.Battlefield.Misshapen Fiend.Tapped = false
